Feature: Heating
  The kettle starts off. Drag the dial past 55 % to start it, the way you would turn an old
  stovetop knob, or press START.

  Expectation: Turning the dial up starts the kettle
    Holding the dial above 55 % for a moment starts it.
    Given the kettle is off
    When the dial is above 55 %
    Then the kettle is heating

  Expectation: The start button starts the kettle
    Given the kettle is off
    When the user presses start
    Then the kettle is heating

  Expectation: Running dry stops the kettle
    Given the kettle is heating
    When the water runs out
    Then the kettle is dry

  Expectation: Reset turns the kettle off
    With the dial still up it would start again straight away, so this is about resetting
    with the dial down.
    Given the dial is below 55 %
    When the user presses reset
    Then the kettle is off
